Package: xen-qubes-dom0
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Devuan dom0 Xen package scaffold for the Qubes-derived port
 Packaging scaffold for the Xen and Qubes-specific patch stack used by the
 Devuan+runit dom0 target. This is currently a porting placeholder, not a
 build-complete Debian package.

Package: libvchan-xen1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Xen libvchan runtime scaffold for the Devuan dom0 port
 Runtime package placeholder for the Xen libvchan library required by Qubes
 dom0 components such as qrexec.

Package: libvchan-xen-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libvchan-xen1 (= ${binary:Version})
